if&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: -0.05pt;;display:inline;"&gt;lives of the pipeline, there is uncertainty regarding both the amount and timing of incurring these costs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div  style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 12pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 12pt;margin-bottom: 3pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;width: 5.22in;"&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.22in;"&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: top;width: 160.9pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 12pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: top;width: 215.85pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 11.1pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.70in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 2.65pt;text-ali